#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:mrp_mail.field_mrp_production__alias_domain
msgid "Alias Domain Name"
msgstr "Nom d'alias de domaine"

#. module: mrp_mail
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:mrp_mail.field_mrp_production__alias_full_name
msgid "Alias Email"
msgstr "Alias de messagerie"

#. module: mrp_mail
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:mrp_mail.field_mrp_production__alias_name
msgid "Alias Name"
msgstr "Alias du Nom"

#. module: mrp_mail
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:mrp_mail.field_mrp_production__alias_status
msgid "Alias Status"
msgstr "Statut de l'alias"

#. module: mrp_mail
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:mrp_mail.field_mrp_production__alias_status
msgid "Alias status assessed on the last message received."
msgstr "État de fonctionnement de l’alias e-mail basé sur le dernier e-mail reçu"

#. module: mrp_mail
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:mrp_mail.field_mrp_production__alias_model_id
msgid "Aliased Model"
msgstr "Modèle concerné"

#. module: mrp_mail
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:mrp_mail.field_mrp_production__alias_bounced_content
msgid "Custom Bounced Message"
msgstr "Message rejeté personnalisé"

#. module: mrp_mail
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:mrp_mail.field_mrp_production__alias_defaults
msgid "Default Values"
msgstr "Valeurs par défaut"

#. module: mrp_mail
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:mrp_mail.mrp_production_form_view
msgid "Email"
msgstr "Courriel"

#. module: mrp_mail
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:mrp_mail.field_mrp_production__alias_email
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:mrp_mail.mrp_production_form_view
msgid "Email Alias"
msgstr "Alias de courriel"

#. module: mrp_mail
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:mrp_mail.field_mrp_production__alias_domain
msgid "Email domain e.g. 'example.com' in 'odoo@example.com'"
msgstr "Domaine de l'e-mail ex:'example.com' dans ‘odoo@example.com'"

#. module: mrp_mail
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:mrp_mail.field_mrp_production__alias_parent_thread_id
msgid ""
"ID of the parent record holding the alias (example: project holding the task "
"creation alias)"
msgstr ""
"ID de l'enregistrement parent qui contient l'alias (exemple: le projet qui "
"contient l'alias lié à la tâche)"

#. module: mrp_mail
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:mrp_mail.field_mrp_production__alias_bounced_content
msgid ""
"If set, this content will automatically be sent out to unauthorized users "
"instead of the default message."
msgstr ""
"S'il est défini, ce contenu sera automatiquement envoyé aux utilisateurs non "
"autorisés au lieu du message par défaut."

#. module: mrp_mail
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:mrp_mail.field_mrp_production__alias_id
msgid ""
"Internal email associated with this production order. Incoming emails are "
"automatically added as chat message."
msgstr ""
"E-mail interne associé à cette fabrication. Les e-mails entrants sont "
"automatiquement ajoutés en tant que message de chat."

#. module: mrp_mail
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:mrp_mail.field_mrp_production__alias_incoming_local
msgid "Local-part based incoming detection"
msgstr "Détection de l'arrivée d'une partie locale"

#. module: mrp_mail
#: model:ir.model,name:mrp_mail.model_mrp_production
msgid "Manufacturing Order"
msgstr "Fabrication"

#. module: mrp_mail
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:mrp_mail.field_mrp_production__alias_force_thread_id
msgid ""
"Optional ID of a thread (record) to which all incoming messages will be "
"attached, even if they did not reply to it. If set, this will disable the "
"creation of new records completely."
msgstr ""
"ID optionnel d'un fil (enregistrement) auquel tout message entrant sera "
"rattaché, même si il ne s'agissait pas d'une réponse à ce fil. Si renseigné, "
"la création de nouveaux enregistrements sera complètement désactivée."

#. module: mrp_mail
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:mrp_mail.field_mrp_production__alias_parent_model_id
msgid "Parent Model"
msgstr "Modèle parent"

#. module: mrp_mail
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:mrp_mail.field_mrp_production__alias_parent_thread_id
msgid "Parent Record Thread ID"
msgstr "ID du Parent de l'enregistrement de la discussion"

#. module: mrp_mail
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:mrp_mail.field_mrp_production__alias_parent_model_id
msgid ""
"Parent model holding the alias. The model holding the alias reference is not "
"necessarily the model given by alias_model_id (example: project (parent_model) "
"and task (model))"
msgstr ""
"Modèle parent de l'alias. Le modèle possédant la référence de l'alias n'est "
"pas nécessairement le modèle donné par alias_model_id (Ex. : project "
"(parent_model) et task (modèle))"

#. module: mrp_mail
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:mrp_mail.field_mrp_production__alias_contact
msgid ""
"Policy to post a message on the document using the mailgateway.\n"
"- everyone: everyone can post\n"
"- partners: only authenticated partners\n"
"- followers: only followers of the related document or members of following "
"channels\n"
msgstr ""
"Politique de publication d'un message sur le document via la passerelle de "
"courriel.\n"
"- tout le monde : tout le monde peut publier\n"
"- partenaires : seulement les partenaires authentifiés\n"
"- abonnés : seulement les abonnés au canaux de suivi\n"

#. module: mrp_mail
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:mrp_mail.field_mrp_production__alias_force_thread_id
msgid "Record Thread ID"
msgstr "ID de l'enregistrement du fil"

#. module: mrp_mail
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:mrp_mail.field_mrp_production__alias_model_id
msgid ""
"The model (Odoo Document Kind) to which this alias corresponds. Any incoming "
"email that does not reply to an existing record will cause the creation of a "
"new record of this model (e.g. a Project Task)"
msgstr ""
"Le modèle (sorte de document Odoo) auquel correspond cet alias. Tout les e-"
"mail entrant ne correspondant pas à un enregistrement existant entraînera la "
"création d'un nouvel enregistrement de ce modèle (Ex. : une tâche d'un projet)"

#. module: mrp_mail
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:mrp_mail.field_mrp_production__alias_name
msgid ""
"The name of the email alias, e.g. 'jobs' if you want to catch emails for "
"<jobs@example.odoo.com>"
msgstr ""
"Le nom de l'alias de messagerie, par exemple 'carrieres' pour relever les e-"
"mails de <carrieres@example.odoo.com>"

